  "validation_notes": [
    "Each process generated fresh keys. Within a process, dual and single paths use identical keys and input ciphertexts.",
    "--repeats repeats computation under the same key; it is not an independent-key trial.",
    "Default maximum-error threshold is 1e-3 because R=128 with no arcsine has about 4.02e-4 bias on constant 1. A separate 1e-4 negative test fails as expected.",
    "22-degree K=12 H=32 failed in both paths; do not generalize H=5 success to H=32.",
    "30-degree H=32 tests passed under different fresh keys; this is not a failure-probability study.",
    "The requested degree-59 discrete fit produced actual degree 58. An initial test-only exact-degree assertion rejected it before evaluation; the final harness reports requested and actual degrees separately.",
    "Earlier runs preceded the final test-only algebra and degree-reporting additions; the first small run also preceded restoration of the original three-argument DFT create wrapper. Bootstrap arithmetic was unchanged by these subsequent edits.",
    "All default paths are retained; the new real-only API cannot check encrypted message type."
  ],
